    section, and the repository's contributor guide, `CLAUDE.md`, says when an author
    should use it.
    -> spec-7-1-describes-context-section  [docs_config/explicit, code_only]
       The spec's description of the task file format (§7.1) includes a description of
       the Context section.
       why code_only: This is a documentation property of the spec text, which a reader
       confirms by reading §7.1; no test would add anything.
    -> claude-md-states-when-to-use-context-section  [docs_config/explicit, code_only]
       The repository's contributor guide, CLAUDE.md, contains guidance stating when a
       task-file author should use the Context section.
       why code_only: This is a documentation-content property of CLAUDE.md that a
       reader confirms by reading the file; no executable behavior exists for a test to
